      "content": "Wait, what? I don't know what you're talking about. I'm looking for professional logistics advice, not folklore. This is a serious problem with a shipment of high-value seafood. Can you please ignore that and just give me the actual technical steps for assessing the safety of the product after a temperature excursion? I need to know if we have to scrap the whole batch.",
